WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
I've listened to it too often.

2
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:06.400
And besides, did you not see that I was inside of you?

3
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.960
Now, we said that endlessly to her.

4
00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:12.160
Now, I don't want to criticize Louisa

5
00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:16.200
because what do we actually see

6
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.840
that's going on inside of ourselves?

7
00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:21.800
Don't we run after counselors and spiritual directors

8
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:25.080
and say to people, look, this is what happened to me.

9
00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:26.880
What's going on?

10
00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:30.080
We're actually very slow to really get it.

11
00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:34.280
It's because this is put down objectively on paper

12
00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:37.720
that you and I can see it.

13
00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:41.520
And it's put down there for our benefit.

14
00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:43.480
It's not there for her benefit.

15
00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:45.600
It's that you and I need to know that Jesus

16
00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:47.480
will never, ever, ever leave us

17
00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:50.520
because we're going straight into the chastisement.

18
00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:55.200
And we need to remember that, that he doesn't leave us.

19
00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:59.720
And he said, didn't you realize I was inside of you?

20
00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:01.480
Because that's what the church teaches us,

21
00:01:01.480 --> 00:01:06.480
that for a soul in grace, that the Blessed Trinity actually

22
00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:11.280
indwells us and has been there since baptism.

23
00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:14.080
He said, I was inside of you.

24
00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:15.560
I wasn't outside of you.

25
00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:22.560
He said, and not only me, but the whole world was there.

26
00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:26.000
Ah, now she gets it.

27
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:29.320
Not only was Jesus there, because she saw him isolated,

28
00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:33.840
and she saw herself isolated, and that this space was the world.

29
00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:36.800
And so the crushing that he was experiencing,

30
00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:40.440
she was getting her dose of that crushing as well.

31
00:01:40.440 --> 00:01:43.680
So now she knows what was going on earlier

32
00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:46.960
when she described it, and that she felt herself being

33
00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:50.000
completely undone, and then that the Lord had to build her up

34
00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:51.080
again.

35
00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:56.080
OK, so it's very interesting at this particular point

36
00:01:56.080 --> 00:01:58.200
that the Lord chose her how to make

37
00:01:58.200 --> 00:02:03.160
reparation for our thoughts out.

38
00:02:03.160 --> 00:02:06.880
You need to go to the book of Proverbs.

39
00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:09.240
There's so much about thoughts and words

40
00:02:09.240 --> 00:02:10.280
in the book of Proverbs.

41
00:02:10.280 --> 00:02:12.000
It's just amazing.

42
00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:14.160
But one of the things that the book of Proverbs says,

43
00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:17.280
and there's an old translation in my head now,

44
00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:20.480
as a man, think it so easy.

45
00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:23.080
In other words, you are what you think.

46
00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:27.120
And if we are to really hand ourselves over

47
00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:30.760
to the divine will, the battle is up here.

48
00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:33.400
The battle is in our thought life.

49
00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:37.600
And if we get the thought life surrendered, we're OK.

50
00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:41.440
The feelings will follow like the characters of the train.

51
00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:46.800
The thoughts are the driver, the driver's cabin in the train.

52
00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:49.120
And people make a huge mistake in thinking

53
00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:52.240
that I can say all these wonderful prayers and everything.

54
00:02:52.240 --> 00:02:53.480
But my thoughts are mine.

55
00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:55.360
Do you mind?

56
00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:57.600
No, no, St. Paul says in 2 Corinthians 10,

57
00:02:57.600 --> 00:03:03.200
5 that every thought must be captured and given to Christ.

58
00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:07.680
So if you've never done penance before, try that one.

59
00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:10.120
And you'll know what penance is when

60
00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:12.120
you want to criticize somebody in your thoughts

61
00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:16.520
and they've got to stop.

62
00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:21.840
So I want to give you just one proverb, 23, 7.

63
00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:24.760
And as I said, 2 Corinthians 10, 5.

64
00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:27.840
So in looking at Jesus, Louisa could

65
00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:34.920
see his intelligence as something much greater than a sun.

66
00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:38.640
Now you have to remember, the sun is the image in this book

67
00:03:38.640 --> 00:03:40.360
for so many things.

68
00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:45.040
So the sun is a source of light and heat and growth

69
00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:47.600
and life for things on the earth.

70
00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:51.000
So if she says a sun, it's a source of life and heat

71
00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:54.800
and growth and everything else.

72
00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:57.080
So I could see his intelligence, she said,

73
00:03:57.080 --> 00:03:58.760
as more than a sun.

74
00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:02.040
And all the thoughts of Jesus were

75
00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:05.560
like many rays which came out of the sun.

76
00:04:05.560 --> 00:04:10.320
So pictured the sun now and all these rays coming out of it.

77
00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:13.600
And extending, she said, they covered

78
00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:16.120
all the thoughts of all human beings

79
00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:19.840
past, present, and future, including yours and mine.

80
00:04:19.840 --> 00:04:27.600
These rays, which are the thoughts of Jesus,

81
00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:30.840
traveling in order to take as though in their power

82
00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:35.400
all created intelligence and to substitute for them

83
00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:41.400
as perennial glory to the Father, complete reparation

84
00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:46.040
for everything, because if human beings change the way

85
00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:49.720
they think, then the way they run the world automatically

86
00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:50.400
changes.

87
00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:56.000
The way we run the church automatically changes

88
00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:57.800
if we change our way of thinking.

89
00:04:57.800 --> 00:05:01.880
So metanoia, the Greek word, is to change your way of thinking.

90
00:05:01.880 --> 00:05:11.120
So Jesus taught like rays of the sun covered

91
00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:13.720
all the thoughts of all human beings past, present,

92
00:05:13.720 --> 00:05:16.800
and future.

93
00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:21.800
In order to substitute for them, oh dear,

94
00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:26.800
lots of our thoughts wouldn't stay in the presence of God.

95
00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:31.600
And to give complete reparation to the Lord.

96
00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:36.720
And also, my book uses the awful word, impatriation.

97
00:05:36.720 --> 00:05:38.640
You have it there as well.

98
00:05:38.640 --> 00:05:44.480
And to give intercession to intercede for all goods,

99
00:05:44.480 --> 00:05:46.920
for all created intelligences.

100
00:05:46.920 --> 00:05:51.320
Now, here are we sinning away as happy as we like

101
00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:52.600
with our thoughts.

102
00:05:52.600 --> 00:05:54.800
And the Lord has gone to enormous trouble

103
00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:57.640
to cover all our thoughts with His thoughts

104
00:05:57.640 --> 00:06:00.640
and to make reparation for all our thoughts.

105
00:06:00.640 --> 00:06:03.320
Now, one of the things, if we want the human race

106
00:06:03.320 --> 00:06:06.960
to come back to God, is that we have to enter into this reparation

107
00:06:06.960 --> 00:06:07.960
and do it as well.

108
00:06:07.960 --> 00:06:16.360
So then drawing me to himself, Louisa,

109
00:06:16.360 --> 00:06:18.840
said, Jesus told me, my daughter,

110
00:06:18.840 --> 00:06:22.760
this son which you see within the intelligence of my humanity

111
00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:25.120
was formed by my divinity.

112
00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:28.560
And it endowed me with the creative power

113
00:06:28.560 --> 00:06:33.280
and the all-seeingness of all things.

114
00:06:33.280 --> 00:06:36.640
Now, you know, this is one of these points

115
00:06:36.640 --> 00:06:39.560
in Louisa where you could spend the next hour

116
00:06:39.560 --> 00:06:41.800
just talking about this.

117
00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:43.440
But I'm not going to do that.

118
00:06:43.440 --> 00:06:47.200
Perhaps you would do some looking up yourselves.

119
00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:53.040
If you go to the Prophet Ezekiel and chapter 1,

120
00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:57.160
he tries to describe the all-seeingness

121
00:06:57.160 --> 00:07:01.520
and the all-knowingness of God.

122
00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:04.600
And he describes the most exotic creatures

123
00:07:04.600 --> 00:07:07.960
around God's throne, they're all angels.

124
00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:10.360
And they have eyes all over the place.

125
00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:12.120
Eyes on their wings and on their bodies

126
00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:15.080
and on their face and on their head and absolutely everywhere.

127
00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:20.800
And that is his graphic way of saying they can see everything.

128
00:07:20.800 --> 00:07:22.600
They know everything.

129
00:07:22.600 --> 00:07:25.520
They understand everything.

130
00:07:25.520 --> 00:07:28.600
Now, this all-seeingness is extremely important

131
00:07:28.600 --> 00:07:32.400
because when you go to the gospel,

132
00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:36.000
you have Jesus standing in a synagogue

133
00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:39.440
and the Pharisees are criticizing him in their taught life,

134
00:07:39.440 --> 00:07:40.640
in their minds.

135
00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:43.600
And Jesus says, "Well, why are you thinking this?"

136
00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:47.400
And then he argues their way out of it.

137
00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:49.160
He can read their thoughts.

138
00:07:49.160 --> 00:07:51.520
The saints were able to read people's thoughts.

139
00:07:51.520 --> 00:07:54.280
Now, reading a person's mind is not actually

140
00:07:54.280 --> 00:07:55.760
as difficult as you might think.

141
00:07:55.760 --> 00:07:57.280
That's why I'm not going to go down that route.

142
00:07:57.280 --> 00:08:00.000
This is big.

143
00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:03.960
But one of the signs of a person very close to God

144
00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:08.640
is that they can see more and more and more and more

145
00:08:08.640 --> 00:08:13.400
because you are penetrating into the sphere of eternity.

146
00:08:13.400 --> 00:08:18.400
And you are taking on their way of thinking and being

147
00:08:18.400 --> 00:08:21.680
and seeing and hearing and understanding

148
00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:25.160
because you're beginning to live a divine life

149
00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:30.680
and a divine life will see through all the mess that's on the earth

150
00:08:30.680 --> 00:08:37.000
and all the total waste of time that's going on.

151
00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:40.680
And he said, "He used this all-seeingness,"

152
00:08:40.680 --> 00:08:46.920
he said, "in such a way that I was able to be a new son for souls."

153
00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:49.640
Now, capitalist this time.

154
00:08:49.640 --> 00:08:54.440
Therefore, Jesus became the source of light.

155
00:08:54.440 --> 00:08:59.520
And in the scriptures, life and light are interchangeable.

156
00:08:59.520 --> 00:09:04.280
So I want to give you John chapter 1, verses 1 and 9,

157
00:09:04.280 --> 00:09:08.920
that Jesus is the light of life.

158
00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:11.920
And he's the life of light.

159
00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:14.240
So light and life are interchangeable.

160
00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:19.040
And in John 8, 12, Jesus said, "I am the light of the world."

161
00:09:19.040 --> 00:09:24.320
In other words, it is through me, with me, and in me,

162
00:09:24.320 --> 00:09:25.600
that you will see.

163
00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:31.120
Now, that's also-- ooh, what is it-- Sam?

164
00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:37.480
I think it's 36, verse 9, "Lord, in your light we see light."

165
00:09:37.480 --> 00:09:41.360
So any possibility we have of having perception

166
00:09:41.360 --> 00:09:45.440
or depth of understanding, it's only through him.

167
00:09:45.440 --> 00:09:50.320
And even the saints and the spiritual writers

168
00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:54.600
down the centuries have all said that when we come

169
00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:57.440
to understand spiritual things more and more,

170
00:09:57.440 --> 00:10:00.520
it is the process of enlightenment

171
00:10:00.520 --> 00:10:02.880
that is the light entering into us,

172
00:10:02.880 --> 00:10:06.440
giving us wisdom, understanding, counsel, fortitude,

173
00:10:06.440 --> 00:10:09.280
knowledge, piety, and the fear of the Lord.

174
00:10:09.280 --> 00:10:13.280
Sorry, I'm not up to date with the funny names they use nowadays.

175
00:10:13.280 --> 00:10:17.080
So Jesus said, "I was able to be a new son for souls.

176
00:10:17.080 --> 00:10:20.760
That is a source of life and light."

177
00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:24.440
And just as the son, which I created in the heavens,

178
00:10:24.440 --> 00:10:26.360
covers the whole earth with its light

179
00:10:26.360 --> 00:10:29.400
without denying the effects to anyone,

180
00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:31.720
though it doesn't depart from the heavens,

181
00:10:31.720 --> 00:10:33.920
but it unleashes from its centers

182
00:10:33.920 --> 00:10:37.440
the rays which bring to the earth the goods that the son

183
00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:41.680
contains, that's the life and the light and the ability

184
00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:44.520
to grow and to enable the plants to photosynthesize

185
00:10:44.520 --> 00:10:46.160
and all of that.

186
00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:51.040
So in the same way, he said, "Without departing from me,

187
00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:56.120
with its inaccessible light," that's one Timothy.

188
00:10:56.120 --> 00:10:57.520
Oh, sorry, it's not one Timothy.

189
00:10:57.520 --> 00:11:00.480
It's two, I wrote down one for some reason.

190
00:11:00.480 --> 00:11:04.000
It's two Timothy at six, 16,

191
00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:07.960
God dwells in unapproachable light, okay?

192
00:11:07.960 --> 00:11:11.000
So Jesus says, "In the same way without departing

193
00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:13.520
from me, with its inaccessible light,

194
00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:17.960
my divinity formed in the spokes of light."

195
00:11:17.960 --> 00:11:21.640
Now, spokes and rays are talking about the same thing.

196
00:11:21.640 --> 00:11:24.800
But if you think of spokes, think of a bicycle

197
00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:26.760
and you've got this center

198
00:11:26.760 --> 00:11:28.800
and all the spokes are coming out of this center

199
00:11:28.800 --> 00:11:31.400
and then you have the rim which represents the world.

200
00:11:31.400 --> 00:11:36.400
So all the spokes are governed and held in this center.

201
00:11:36.400 --> 00:11:40.160
So he said, "Spokes of life came out from me

202
00:11:40.160 --> 00:11:44.400
and these rays covered everyone and everything."

203
00:11:44.400 --> 00:11:46.800
Now, notice the love without borders.

204
00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:53.560
And Jesus said, "And I, at each instant,"

205
00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:58.160
now watch this, "covered each thought.

206
00:11:58.160 --> 00:12:01.400
At each instant, I covered each word.

207
00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:05.800
At each instant, I covered each act of all creatures."

208
00:12:05.800 --> 00:12:07.440
Now, he does it at each instant.

209
00:12:07.440 --> 00:12:10.000
That's why I say to the Lord,

210
00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:14.200
I want to fuse all of me in all of you all the time

211
00:12:14.200 --> 00:12:16.240
every nanosecond.

212
00:12:16.240 --> 00:12:19.040
If you want to support me every instant,

213
00:12:19.040 --> 00:12:22.400
I want to be in there to be supported every instant.

214
00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:25.040
This is a two-way process.

215
00:12:25.040 --> 00:12:31.120
So he said, "I, at each instant, covered each thought.

216
00:12:31.120 --> 00:12:32.320
I covered each word.

217
00:12:32.320 --> 00:12:35.120
I covered each act of all creatures.

218
00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:38.440
And I constituted myself the perennial glory

219
00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:42.000
to the Father for each thought, word, and so on

220
00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:43.560
of all human generations.

221
00:12:43.560 --> 00:12:45.440
Perennial means continuous.

222
00:12:45.440 --> 00:12:51.200
And by "continuously" means from Adam to me

223
00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:55.880
and from me to the end, from Adam to Zachary.

224
00:12:55.880 --> 00:12:58.400
Every single one of us, he covered us all.

225
00:12:58.400 --> 00:13:02.680
We have absolutely no excuse for not reaching the fullness.

226
00:13:02.680 --> 00:13:04.360
We have no excuse at all.

227
00:13:04.360 --> 00:13:06.400
He's done everything for us.

228
00:13:06.400 --> 00:13:09.440
We just have to enter into it, surrender to it,

229
00:13:09.440 --> 00:13:10.680
let him take over.

230
00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:15.000
While rising to the eternal Father,

231
00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:17.800
he said, "This light descended to take

232
00:13:17.800 --> 00:13:20.120
as though in its power all human acts

233
00:13:20.120 --> 00:13:22.360
in order to illuminate them."

234
00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:26.400
Yes, you're John 812 and 9.5 again.

235
00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:29.560
To warm them, to take away the dreadful coldness

236
00:13:29.560 --> 00:13:32.080
of our unbelief and stubbornness and everything,

237
00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:33.240
and to repair them.

238
00:13:35.320 --> 00:13:40.320
So, over each human act hovers a light.

239
00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:46.680
A light that wants to do good to that act.

240
00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:50.640
Now, here I am, the action I'm doing at this moment

241
00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:54.640
is trying to reflect on this wonderful material

242
00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:56.800
that the Lord revealed to Louisa.

243
00:13:56.800 --> 00:13:59.440
And hovering over me is this light

244
00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:02.600
that actually wants to come in

245
00:14:02.600 --> 00:14:06.880
and enlighten the darkness of my intellect

246
00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:11.440
and uncover the memory, stir the will,

247
00:14:11.440 --> 00:14:14.640
stir the heart so that what actually comes out

248
00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:18.560
of this exercise is something divine and not just human.

249
00:14:18.560 --> 00:14:24.280
I just gave you that so that we get practical about it.

250
00:14:24.280 --> 00:14:30.760
In me, Jesus said, 'cause he was man and God,

251
00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:32.720
doing this was his own natural.

252
00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:35.960
He said, "My daughter, you don't have this power.

253
00:14:35.960 --> 00:14:38.360
"You can't make a single act out of all acts.

254
00:14:38.360 --> 00:14:41.440
"That's what only God can do that."

255
00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:43.280
Therefore, in my will, he said,

256
00:14:43.280 --> 00:14:48.280
"You have to go through each ray covering human thoughts."

257
00:14:48.280 --> 00:14:53.120
Oh, dear, one by one, little by little.

258
00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:55.680
And you'll follow the same path as my humanity.

259
00:14:57.480 --> 00:15:01.160
He could do them all in one fell swoop.

260
00:15:01.160 --> 00:15:02.800
We have to do it bit by bit.

261
00:15:02.800 --> 00:15:06.520
That's like saying, I'm not giving you the blouse.

262
00:15:06.520 --> 00:15:09.760
I'm giving you the threads that make the blouse

263
00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:12.460
and you have to put these threads together.

264
00:15:12.460 --> 00:15:16.480
So he's telling us we have work to do

265
00:15:16.480 --> 00:15:18.640
in our acts in the divine will.

266
00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:24.840
So she immediately goes into obedience

267
00:15:24.840 --> 00:15:27.360
and trying to do what he has asked of her.

268
00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:29.640
So she said, "I tried to go through the first ray,

269
00:15:29.640 --> 00:15:32.160
"that is of human thoughts."

270
00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:34.720
And then through the second and so on.

271
00:15:34.720 --> 00:15:37.040
But, oh, power of the divine will,

272
00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:40.080
while going through those rays, I was so little

273
00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:42.880
that I seem to have become an atom.

274
00:15:42.880 --> 00:15:46.480
Now, notice you can only succeed in your nothingness.

275
00:15:46.480 --> 00:15:51.040
If Francis thinks she's important enough to do this

276
00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:55.240
because she's Francis will then go and do something else.

277
00:15:55.240 --> 00:15:56.800
You're wasting your time.

278
00:15:56.800 --> 00:16:00.000
She discovers that in her nothingness,

279
00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:02.560
she's lifted up and enabled to do it.

280
00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:07.600
But if there's something blocking that nothingness,

281
00:16:07.600 --> 00:16:08.760
it's not gonna happen.

282
00:16:08.760 --> 00:16:12.920
She said, "Because I am an atom,

283
00:16:12.920 --> 00:16:16.200
"now don't forget that something very, very small

284
00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:18.360
"can really get places.

285
00:16:18.360 --> 00:16:22.840
"The light can come in because it's made up

286
00:16:22.840 --> 00:16:25.680
"of extremely tiny particles."

287
00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:31.800
And he tells us that we have to get into this nothingness

288
00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:36.480
so that in our nothingness, we can enter into the divine will

289
00:16:36.480 --> 00:16:39.000
and we can enter therefore into the intelligences

290
00:16:39.000 --> 00:16:41.600
of creatures and affect them for good.

291
00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:46.320
But if there's anything of the self there,

292
00:16:46.320 --> 00:16:48.000
no, it's not gonna work.

293
00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:53.400
And so it's desperately important that if I say to the Lord,

294
00:16:53.400 --> 00:16:56.480
I fuse all of me in all of you all the time,

295
00:16:56.480 --> 00:16:59.040
I have to say the next sentence is,

296
00:16:59.040 --> 00:17:03.800
and I plunge myself into my abject nothingness

297
00:17:03.800 --> 00:17:08.040
so that this nothingness can flow in your allness.

298
00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:11.440
Those two go together, 'cause it's only in our nothingness

299
00:17:11.440 --> 00:17:12.920
that the thing actually works.

300
00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:18.560
So she said, "I was so little that I seem

301
00:17:18.560 --> 00:17:21.400
"to have become an atom, but the atom was now

302
00:17:21.400 --> 00:17:23.160
"in the divine intelligence."

303
00:17:23.160 --> 00:17:24.960
See, that's the difference.

304
00:17:24.960 --> 00:17:28.920
Because she's so small, so tiny,

305
00:17:28.920 --> 00:17:33.680
the infinite intelligence of God allows her to come in.

306
00:17:33.680 --> 00:17:35.680
'Cause no pride is allowed in, you see?

307
00:17:35.680 --> 00:17:37.040
Nothing unholy or unwary.

308
00:17:37.040 --> 00:17:38.760
They can enter the presence of God.

309
00:17:38.760 --> 00:17:40.960
So pride and arrogance and self importance

310
00:17:40.960 --> 00:17:42.560
and all of that, that doesn't get in.

311
00:17:42.560 --> 00:17:47.320
So now that she's in the divine intelligence

312
00:17:47.320 --> 00:17:51.920
'cause she's fused, that's the difference.

313
00:17:51.920 --> 00:17:54.400
And that's what makes it possible for us

314
00:17:54.400 --> 00:17:56.720
to do what the Lord actually asks.

315
00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:59.640
And she said, "Because of that,

316
00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:03.000
"going through the intelligences of all creatures."

317
00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:06.360
At one stage, she said, "I went through the word

318
00:18:06.360 --> 00:18:09.200
"and then in the divine motion,

319
00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:12.000
"going through the words of creatures."

320
00:18:12.000 --> 00:18:18.520
So she goes through the thought

321
00:18:18.520 --> 00:18:20.480
and then the thoughts of creatures, the word

322
00:18:20.480 --> 00:18:22.120
and the words of creatures, the acts

323
00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:24.920
and the acts of creatures and so on and so forth.

324
00:18:24.920 --> 00:18:30.600
And the divinity in seeing my extreme littleness

325
00:18:30.600 --> 00:18:34.400
within their intelligence, within their word

326
00:18:34.400 --> 00:18:38.560
and within their emotion, taken by love from my littleness,

327
00:18:38.560 --> 00:18:41.560
notice the emphasis on the littleness all the time.

328
00:18:41.560 --> 00:18:44.160
They remained and raptured and they were pleased.

329
00:18:44.160 --> 00:18:47.560
I want to give you one piece or five, five to nine.

330
00:18:47.560 --> 00:18:51.880
The devil can only attack if there's something there to attack.

331
00:18:51.880 --> 00:18:55.640
But if there's nothing for the devil to attack.

332
00:18:55.640 --> 00:18:58.280
So now you know the solution.

333
00:18:58.280 --> 00:19:05.560
And the Holy Trinity said, "This littleness enraptures us

334
00:19:05.560 --> 00:19:09.480
"and in seeing her enter into our very acts

335
00:19:09.480 --> 00:19:11.600
"to do them together with us

336
00:19:11.600 --> 00:19:15.240
"and to diffuse them over all souls,

337
00:19:15.240 --> 00:19:18.800
"we feel such joy and such satisfaction

338
00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:23.800
"because love is being allowed to operate in a human being.

339
00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:27.800
"They are infinite, absolute, divine love.

340
00:19:27.800 --> 00:19:30.240
"But love is now operating in a human being

341
00:19:30.240 --> 00:19:34.480
"who wants to do something to help other human beings.

342
00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:36.560
"Love serves, you see.

343
00:19:36.560 --> 00:19:40.800
"And love lives by giving, giving, giving, giving all the time."

344
00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:45.440
So they were absolutely delicious.

345
00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:49.200
So this littleness enraptures us

346
00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:51.520
and in seeing her enter our very acts

347
00:19:51.520 --> 00:19:53.320
to do them together with us

348
00:19:53.320 --> 00:19:54.920
and to diffuse them over all,

349
00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:59.360
we feel such joy and such satisfaction

350
00:19:59.360 --> 00:20:02.340
as we receive our own glory.

351
00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:07.360
And with all love we give her the freedom to enter into us

352
00:20:07.360 --> 00:20:09.240
and let her operate within us

353
00:20:09.240 --> 00:20:12.160
because operating within the blessed Trinity

354
00:20:12.160 --> 00:20:16.560
is operating in love and in service to God and man.

355
00:20:18.160 --> 00:20:21.240
Louisa said she felt all confused on hearing this

356
00:20:21.240 --> 00:20:23.560
and she said to herself, "I'm not doing anything."

357
00:20:23.560 --> 00:20:26.280
It's the divine will who carries me in his arms

358
00:20:26.280 --> 00:20:31.280
and therefore all the glory is of the adorable will.

359
00:20:31.280 --> 00:20:35.280
But you see, we have to remember what we were told

360
00:20:35.280 --> 00:20:36.120
at the very beginning,

361
00:20:36.120 --> 00:20:39.200
which is if you desire it, I will do it, Jesus says.

362
00:20:39.200 --> 00:20:44.200
So our acts and prayers seem to be nothing to us.

363
00:20:44.200 --> 00:20:46.320
We're saying nice things, okay.

364
00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:52.480
So Jesus has to explain what actually happens

365
00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:57.080
when we fuse ourselves and enter the sphere of eternity

366
00:20:57.080 --> 00:21:01.920
and that's where we're going in January 27, 1925.

367
00:21:01.920 --> 00:21:04.360
So there's wonderful teaching here

368
00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:07.760
on entering the sphere of eternity.

369
00:21:07.760 --> 00:21:12.760
So what is fusing, what happens and who does what, okay.

370
00:21:15.720 --> 00:21:19.000
So when I was fusing myself

371
00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:21.000
in the holy divine volition, Louisa said,

372
00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:25.720
I talked to myself before when I used to fuse myself

373
00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:30.080
in the holy supreme volition, Jesus was with me.

374
00:21:30.080 --> 00:21:30.920
Hold me a second.

375
00:21:30.920 --> 00:21:40.560
Just hold on a second.

376
00:21:46.720 --> 00:21:51.720
So I want to start again at January the 27th, 1925.

377
00:21:51.720 --> 00:22:00.000
So we're going to look at what fusing actually is.

378
00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:03.880
So Louisa said, while I was fusing myself

379
00:22:03.880 --> 00:22:06.760
in the holy divine volition, I talked to myself

380
00:22:06.760 --> 00:22:10.680
before when I used to fuse myself

381
00:22:10.680 --> 00:22:13.920
in the holy supreme volition, Jesus was with me.

382
00:22:15.040 --> 00:22:17.800
And I would enter into the sphere of eternity.

383
00:22:17.800 --> 00:22:21.480
That's the it together with him.

384
00:22:21.480 --> 00:22:25.600
And so entering it was a reality.

385
00:22:25.600 --> 00:22:28.560
Now she means a felt experience.

386
00:22:28.560 --> 00:22:30.720
I actually felt this happening, she says.

387
00:22:30.720 --> 00:22:33.320
But now I don't see him.

388
00:22:33.320 --> 00:22:37.040
So I don't know whether I enter

389
00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:40.080
into the eternal volition or not.

390
00:22:40.080 --> 00:22:43.760
I feel rather as if it was a little lesson learned by heart

391
00:22:43.760 --> 00:22:45.400
or the way of speaking.

392
00:22:45.400 --> 00:22:47.240
Now what Jesus has done there

393
00:22:47.240 --> 00:22:50.080
is he's got Louisa to express our problem.

394
00:22:50.080 --> 00:22:56.720
She usually enters the divine volition experientially

395
00:22:56.720 --> 00:23:00.680
because he's teaching her to teach everybody else.

396
00:23:00.680 --> 00:23:06.240
But we're learning from her what to do

397
00:23:06.240 --> 00:23:08.440
and we're simply obeying what we were told

398
00:23:08.440 --> 00:23:10.680
and we're hoping it works for us

399
00:23:10.680 --> 00:23:15.680
because we're not having her experiential actions.

400
00:23:15.680 --> 00:23:21.800
And so we have to remember the first letter of Peter,

401
00:23:21.800 --> 00:23:24.440
chapter one, verses eight to nine.

402
00:23:24.440 --> 00:23:26.680
You don't see him but you love him

403
00:23:26.680 --> 00:23:29.160
and you're filled with a joy so glorious

404
00:23:29.160 --> 00:23:31.160
that people are utterly amazed.

405
00:23:31.160 --> 00:23:35.040
And so Jesus has to explain to her our position

406
00:23:35.040 --> 00:23:38.640
that we're acting totally by faith

407
00:23:38.640 --> 00:23:41.160
which is Galatians 3 11.

408
00:23:41.160 --> 00:23:44.080
She was having huge experiences

409
00:23:44.080 --> 00:23:47.080
in order to get this revelation to pass on to us

410
00:23:47.080 --> 00:23:49.640
but we're acting totally in faith.

411
00:23:49.640 --> 00:23:53.580
And so how does it affect us?

412
00:23:53.580 --> 00:23:57.880
Now she says, while I was thinking about this

413
00:23:57.880 --> 00:24:00.840
my beloved Jesus moved in my interior

414
00:24:00.840 --> 00:24:04.560
and taking one of my hands in his, he pushed me up high.

415
00:24:04.560 --> 00:24:07.640
Now watch, she's doing the words,

416
00:24:07.640 --> 00:24:11.480
this is what he's doing, he pushed me up high

417
00:24:11.480 --> 00:24:15.960
and told me, my daughter, you must know

418
00:24:15.960 --> 00:24:18.880
that whether you see me or not,

419
00:24:18.880 --> 00:24:22.720
every time you fuse yourself in my will,

420
00:24:22.720 --> 00:24:26.640
from within your interior, I take your hand

421
00:24:26.640 --> 00:24:29.080
and I push you up high.

422
00:24:29.080 --> 00:24:32.760
In other words, he alone can make it a divine act.

423
00:24:34.560 --> 00:24:37.720
From within your interior, I take your hand

424
00:24:37.720 --> 00:24:39.400
and I push you up high.

425
00:24:39.400 --> 00:24:44.200
And from heaven, I take you with my other hand

426
00:24:44.200 --> 00:24:46.440
to take your other hand and pull you up

427
00:24:46.440 --> 00:24:49.000
into our midst, into our endless will.

428
00:24:49.000 --> 00:24:52.720
In other words, you desire it, I do it.

429
00:24:52.720 --> 00:24:55.640
He is the one who has to make this a divine act for us

430
00:24:55.640 --> 00:24:57.360
'cause he is the one who is divine.

431
00:24:57.360 --> 00:25:04.280
So you are in between my hands and in my arms.

432
00:25:05.000 --> 00:25:09.240
So do your little acts, this is what I'm doing.

433
00:25:09.240 --> 00:25:12.660
We're giving him an opportunity to do this wonderful work.

434
00:25:12.660 --> 00:25:15.840
So in the next paragraph then,

435
00:25:15.840 --> 00:25:18.960
he talks about taking us into his first act.

436
00:25:18.960 --> 00:25:23.720
So you must know, he said, that all the acts done

437
00:25:23.720 --> 00:25:27.080
in our will enter into the first act

438
00:25:27.080 --> 00:25:29.420
when we created the whole universe.

439
00:25:29.420 --> 00:25:32.600
When he said the first fiat

440
00:25:32.600 --> 00:25:34.960
that brought the whole universe into being,

441
00:25:34.960 --> 00:25:37.320
he says, everything you do is in that act.

442
00:25:37.320 --> 00:25:41.800
And the acts of the human being

443
00:25:41.800 --> 00:25:45.120
in becoming one with the divine

444
00:25:45.120 --> 00:25:49.320
because there's only one will in these acts

445
00:25:49.320 --> 00:25:50.460
done in the divine will.

446
00:25:50.460 --> 00:25:55.840
They, he said, they will diffuse over all created things

447
00:25:55.840 --> 00:25:58.540
just as our will is diffused everywhere.

448
00:25:59.440 --> 00:26:02.720
And they constitute themselves the return of love,

449
00:26:02.720 --> 00:26:07.720
adoration and continuous glory for everything.

450
00:26:07.720 --> 00:26:15.400
That means everything that God issued in the universe.

451
00:26:15.400 --> 00:26:22.080
Only that which is done in our will begins almost together

452
00:26:22.080 --> 00:26:24.840
with us, I love the little word almost

453
00:26:24.840 --> 00:26:28.120
because he's telling us that our acts

454
00:26:28.120 --> 00:26:30.600
have got to go back into the divine will

455
00:26:30.600 --> 00:26:34.120
and therefore diffuse over the whole of the universe.

456
00:26:34.120 --> 00:26:35.080
Okay.

457
00:26:35.080 --> 00:26:37.960
And he says, it goes almost back.

458
00:26:37.960 --> 00:26:39.640
Why does he say almost?

459
00:26:39.640 --> 00:26:42.480
Because we weren't there at the fiat.

460
00:26:42.480 --> 00:26:47.480
We come later and it's absolutely fantastic

461
00:26:47.480 --> 00:26:52.240
that our acts can be brought right back into this first act.

462
00:26:57.080 --> 00:27:01.720
So only that which is done in our will,

463
00:27:01.720 --> 00:27:05.200
Jesus said begins almost together with us

464
00:27:05.200 --> 00:27:09.400
to give us the return of perennial love, adoration,

465
00:27:09.400 --> 00:27:13.600
but in a divine manner and a glory that never ends.

466
00:27:13.600 --> 00:27:15.880
We have this extraordinary privilege

467
00:27:15.880 --> 00:27:20.000
of giving divine glory, divine reparation.

468
00:27:20.000 --> 00:27:22.960
It's really unbelievable and divine love

469
00:27:22.960 --> 00:27:24.080
and all the rest of it.

470
00:27:26.560 --> 00:27:30.000
And since the love we have for all the things

471
00:27:30.000 --> 00:27:33.800
created by us, Jesus said is so great

472
00:27:33.800 --> 00:27:37.080
that we did not permit that they go out of our will.

473
00:27:37.080 --> 00:27:39.440
Now, in the first thing he's saying here now,

474
00:27:39.440 --> 00:27:44.920
first of all, he tells us what's happening in the act.

475
00:27:44.920 --> 00:27:47.880
And then he says that our acts have got to be brought

476
00:27:47.880 --> 00:27:51.400
into that first act at the beginning

477
00:27:51.400 --> 00:27:53.480
of the creation of the universe.

478
00:27:53.480 --> 00:27:57.160
And then he's going to separate two lots.

479
00:27:57.160 --> 00:28:02.160
One is that all of creation is as beautiful as it was

480
00:28:02.160 --> 00:28:05.480
in the beginning because they have no free will.

481
00:28:05.480 --> 00:28:08.480
And then he comes in the next paragraph to talk about us

482
00:28:08.480 --> 00:28:10.920
that we're different to the rest of the whole creation

483
00:28:10.920 --> 00:28:13.000
because he wanted something from us

484
00:28:13.000 --> 00:28:17.240
that he didn't ask of anything else in creation

485
00:28:17.240 --> 00:28:21.080
that we would choose to come back.

486
00:28:21.080 --> 00:28:23.400
That we would choose to love him.

487
00:28:23.400 --> 00:28:26.160
That we would choose to surrender to him.

488
00:28:26.160 --> 00:28:29.560
So think of all the, that is in the universe

489
00:28:29.560 --> 00:28:31.160
that doesn't have free will.

490
00:28:31.160 --> 00:28:34.000
And this is what we're talking about now.

491
00:28:34.000 --> 00:28:36.720
Since the love we have for all the things created by us

492
00:28:36.720 --> 00:28:39.320
is so great that we did not permit

493
00:28:39.320 --> 00:28:42.760
that they go out of our will as we created them.

494
00:28:42.760 --> 00:28:46.840
So they all remained with us and our will made itself

495
00:28:46.840 --> 00:28:51.280
the preserver and the nourisher of the whole of creation.

496
00:28:52.280 --> 00:28:55.760
And this is why all things remain fresh and new and beautiful.

497
00:28:55.760 --> 00:28:59.400
Nor do they grow or decrease

498
00:28:59.400 --> 00:29:03.800
as they were all created perfect by us.

499
00:29:03.800 --> 00:29:07.440
And therefore they're not subject to any kind of alteration.

500
00:29:07.440 --> 00:29:10.000
They all preserve their origin

501
00:29:10.000 --> 00:29:12.160
because they allowed themselves to be nourished

502
00:29:12.160 --> 00:29:14.000
and preserved by our will.

503
00:29:14.000 --> 00:29:16.480
And so they remain around us for our glory.

504
00:29:16.480 --> 00:29:19.320
Now we come to human beings.

505
00:29:21.200 --> 00:29:22.520
And this is different.

506
00:29:22.520 --> 00:29:28.800
So we said, now, the working of the human being in our will

507
00:29:28.800 --> 00:29:33.760
enters into our own works.

508
00:29:33.760 --> 00:29:34.960
That's different.

509
00:29:34.960 --> 00:29:39.160
And our will makes itself the nourisher,

510
00:29:39.160 --> 00:29:43.080
the preserver and the act of the very act of the creature.

511
00:29:43.080 --> 00:29:45.840
In other words, we had to explain in the first paragraph

512
00:29:45.840 --> 00:29:49.400
that we do what we can to enter into the divine will.

513
00:29:49.400 --> 00:29:50.720
Jesus does everything else.

514
00:29:50.720 --> 00:29:53.000
In other words, he's the one who actually lifts it up

515
00:29:53.000 --> 00:29:56.720
